column6:
私も日々常に　主の教えに学び
主の御心に報える様　励まなくてはなり{02}

<wait>

column7:
I too study His teachings daily,
and strive to answer His will{02}

<wait>

column6:
それでは足り{02}

もっと　誠意を見せて頂きましょう
<wait>

column7:
That's not enough{02}

Show me more sincerity.
<wait>

column6:
これ以上　むやみに殺戮を繰り返しても
何の意味もあり{02}

<wait>

column7:
Even killing needlessly like this,
it means nothing{02}

<wait>

column6:
まだ貴方は　私の加護を得るには
ふさわしくあり{02}

<wait>

column7:
You are not yet worthy
of my blessing{02}

<wait>
